[I] Hatch plugin to read pyproject.toml metadata from package.json

[T] Hatch plugin to read pyproject.toml metadata from Node.js
[T] package.json files. Provides two Hatch plugins:
[T] 1) version_source_plugin to read/write package version fields
[T] 2) metadata_hook_plugin to read PEP 621 metadata

